    "name": "Iceberg Lettuce",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Iceberg lettuce, also known as&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=bd4c3cf80c4f952f&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;sxsrf=AE3TifO7H_wNiSGlNKttCpwdkgJlUe_G3g%3A1748887421066&amp;q=crisphead+lettuce&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwj4mfCrqdONAxU_JjQIHVGDGeMQxccNegQIIhAB&amp;mstk=AUtExfCnddl7cYW8_lP7HEglkSSR9qmTA3_SdLAxBv18mVR30rVju_aJQuo-xYVXkhf_xvz9RcNy-qNPHxNg7na4jEUVueOTu1wKmq0NABuX2y5OcZOxhGrnP_tmCzRdQ0mONTauQUWqSK3Uvg9Z6alP6MCHtq9b7YYzzUEi4oGaNfDldNuJV9v8YIoJ3U_56CRVsuaE5EoPYsKWrPdRqXgY0Z1zwDTYFNsvv3hOBRgVMzXnAaidh0kzrHqgQBFe9f1O6w4aU3eGoE7nmf9JQ5KoAddD&amp;csui=3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">crisphead lettuce</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;is&nbsp;a popular type of lettuce distinguished by its tightly packed, pale green, and crisp leaves that form a round head.&nbsp;It's known for its mild flavor and crisp texture, making it a common choice for salads and sandwiches.&nbsp;While it's a good source of water and some vitamins and minerals, iceberg lettuce is not as nutrient-dense as other lettuce varieties.&nbsp;</span></p>",
